1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:01,870
(Howard:)Hey, I didn't see
you giving back

2
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:04,710
(Howard:)your Snoopy
snow cone maker.

3
00:00:04,710 --> 00:00:05,840
(Raj:)That was all a lie?

4
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:07,980
(Raj:)This year's gifts
are already wrapped.

5
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:10,710
(Howard:)And as long as we're talking
about betraying our friends,

6
00:00:10,710 --> 00:00:13,180
(Howard:)how about the month Sheldon
spent grinding up insects

7
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:14,920
(Howard:)and mixing them
into Leonard's food?

8
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:16,290
(Sheldon:)Well, excuse me.

9
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:17,890
(Sheldon:)That was not a betrayal.

10
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:20,020
(Sheldon:)That was an experiment
to determine

11
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:24,230
(Sheldon:)at what concentration
food starts tasting "mothy."

12
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:27,400
You put moths in my food?!

13
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:31,270
(Sheldon:)For science.

14
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:33,740
(Raj:)I can't believe you kissed
my sister with moth mouth.

15
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:37,910
Well, I can't believe you
used Sheldon's toothbrush.

16
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:40,210
(Sheldon:)You used my toothbrush?

17
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:43,110
(Raj:)Not the brush part,
just the little rubber thing

18
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:46,950
(Raj:)to pick food from my teeth
and massage my gums.

19
00:00:52,590 --> 00:00:55,620
Okay, I-I think
it's safe to say

20
00:00:55,630 --> 00:00:57,130
(Leonard:)that we've all done
some things

21
00:00:57,130 --> 00:00:58,890
(Leonard:)we're not
particularly proud of.

22
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:01,060
(Leonard:)But come on,
we're friends.

